      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Nastya returns home from her shift that evening, she is shocked to find Max, Kostya, and Rodion Sergeyevich toasting each other at the kitchen table. Having eaten the entire dinner together, the three men cheerfully announce that they are now best friends and are heading out to a karaoke bar.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
