      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to propose a toast to the two of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Вы замечательные люди.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are wonderful people.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "О, Настенька, а мы тут немного это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, Nastenka, we were just having a little bite here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Анастасия Степановна, мне ужасно стыдно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Anastasiya Stepanovna, I am terribly ashamed.'",
