      "t": "Что в дружеской компании мы как-то.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In such friendly company, we somehow got carried away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, все съели, Настенька.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, we ate everything up, Nastenka.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
